---
---
<section class="section-contact-hero" id="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="ch-wrapper">
      
      <div class="ch-content">
        <span class="ch-eyebrow">Solicită un proiect</span>
        
        <h1 class="ch-title">Spuneți-ne ce planificați.</h1>
        
        <div class="ch-narrative">
          <p class="ch-text">
            Nu aveți nevoie de un concept complet dezvoltat sau de un brief detaliat. Pentru început, câteva detalii despre compania dumneavoastră, situația actuală și obiectivul dumneavoastră sunt suficiente.
          </p>
          <p class="ch-text strong">
            Gabriel Pop va analiza personal solicitarea și vă va răspunde direct.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="ch-indicator">
        <a href="#form" class="ch-scroll-link">
          <span class="scroll-text">Descrieți proiectul</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line>
            <polyline points="19 12 12 19 5 12"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-contact-hero {
    padding-top: calc(var(--header-height) + 6rem);
    padding-bottom: 6rem;
    background: #f8fafc;
  }

  .ch-wrapper {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .ch-content {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .ch-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--brand-purple);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .ch-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .ch-narrative {
    max-width: 700px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--brand-navy);
    padding-left: 2.5rem;
  }

  .ch-text {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .ch-text.strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
  }

  .ch-indicator {
    padding-left: 2.5rem;
  }

  .ch-scroll-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }
  .ch-scroll-link:hover {
    color: var(--brand-purple);
  }

  .scroll-text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .ch-scroll-link svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    animation: bounce 2s infinite;
  }

  @keyframes bounce {
    0%, 20%, 50%, 80%, 100% {
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
    40% {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
    }
    60% {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ch-narrative {
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }
    .ch-indicator {
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
